# Raw Bible Hub HTML caches are kept LOCAL and re-fetchable, not committed.
#
# The pages carry site markup, navigation and other non-Bible content; the
# Berean public-domain dedication covers the Bible text, not the page as a
# whole, so the raw captures are not published for redistribution. The
# extraction fixture (pilot.fixture.json), curated annotations, and the
# source-manifest hashes ARE committed as the auditable record.
#
# Run `node build/tools/berean-hebrew-fetch.mjs` to (re)create source-pages/.
source-pages/
